<title>CHINA: China Jan-Apr heavy oil output down 17.8 pct.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Apr heavy oil output down 17.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 6.4032 million tonnes of heavy oil in the first four months of 1997, down 17.8 percent from the year-ago period, said a report issued by the State Statistical Bureau on Thursday.</p>
<p>China produced 1.3285 million tonnes of heavy oil in April alone, the report said without giving a comparative figure.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
